{"id":"en_burn-in-the-alpha-princess-s-wrath","title":"Burn in the Alpha Princess's Wrath","titleEn":"Burn in the Alpha Princess's Wrath","description":"For three years, Freya hid her royal lineage behind the guise of a delicate Omega within the Crimson Moon Pack, where she suffered constant mistreatment and disregard. The breaking point came when her husband demanded she surrender her heart to another woman. In response, Freya severed their mate bond and withdrew to the Nightshade Royal Court. There she resumed her rightful standing as Lycan Princess and Western Governor, deploying overwhelming bloodline authority and financial power to exact merciless retribution upon those who once held her captive.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/burn-in-the-alpha-princesss-wrath/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/burn-in-the-alpha-princesss-wrath/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Contemporary","Female","Misunderstanding","Regret","Werewolf","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjoc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_burn-in-the-alpha-princess-s-wrath_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjoc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_burn-in-the-alpha-princess-s-wrath_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjoc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_burn-in-the-alpha-princess-s-wrath_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjoc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_burn-in-the-alpha-princess-s-wrath_4","title"